  alpha is a LOWER bound (the fused layer's fixed cost sits in the denominator); alpha-hi takes that cost out, and alpha-corrected also removes activation traffic
  alpha here is B/(A+B), which is (alpha_b+phi)/(1+phi+delta) and NOT a weight miss fraction: see moe/bench/ai_model.py and LadderFit.alpha
